msgctxt "NeoStack.IntegrationMetadata,MetaHuman.enablesAgentTo.3"
msgid "Configure, start, poll and cancel MetaHuman Animator Performance processing and export the result as an Animation Sequence or Level Sequence"
msgstr "MetaHuman Animator Performance 처리 구성, 시작, 폴링 및 취소 후 결과를 Animation Sequence 또는 Level Sequence로 내보내기"

#. Key:	MetaHuman.enablesAgentTo.4
msgctxt "NeoStack.IntegrationMetadata,MetaHuman.enablesAgentTo.4"
msgid "Export Creator characters as DCC packages, DNA assets or files, skeletal meshes and material instances (UE 5.8)"
msgstr "Creator 캐릭터를 DCC 패키지, DNA 에셋 또는 파일, 스켈레탈 메시 및 머티리얼 인스턴스로 내보내기(UE 5.8)"

#. Key:	MetaSound.agentSummary
msgctxt "NeoStack.IntegrationMetadata,MetaSound.agentSummary"
msgid "Adds authoring support for UE MetaSound source and patch assets."
msgstr "UE MetaSound Source 및 Patch 에셋 작성 지원을 추가합니다."

