msgstr "WidgetBlueprint 에셋에서 UE AudioWidgets UMG 컨트롤 작성 지원을 추가합니다."

#. Key:	Water.enablesAgentTo.0
msgctxt "NeoStack.IntegrationMetadata,Water.enablesAgentTo.0"
msgid "Inspect Water Body assets and settings"
msgstr "Water Body 에셋 및 설정 검사"

#. Key:	Water.enablesAgentTo.1
msgctxt "NeoStack.IntegrationMetadata,Water.enablesAgentTo.1"
msgid "Configure rivers, oceans, lakes, and water zones"
msgstr "강, 바다, 호수 및 워터 존 구성"

#. Key:	Water.enablesAgentTo.2
msgctxt "NeoStack.IntegrationMetadata,Water.enablesAgentTo.2"
