msgstr "셰이프 툴박스 UI 없이 Motion Design 셰이프 액터 생성"

#. Key:	Avalanche.enablesAgentTo.1
msgctxt "NeoStack.IntegrationMetadata,Avalanche.enablesAgentTo.1"
msgid "Configure rectangle mesh size, slant, bevel, and alignment state"
msgstr "직사각형 메시 크기, 기울기, 베벨 및 정렬 상태 구성"

#. Key:	Avalanche.enablesAgentTo.2
msgctxt "NeoStack.IntegrationMetadata,Avalanche.enablesAgentTo.2"
msgid "Inspect generated dynamic mesh state from editor code"
msgstr "에디터 코드에서 생성된 다이내믹 메시 상태 검사"

#. Key:	AvalancheDataLink.agentSummary
msgctxt "NeoStack.IntegrationMetadata,AvalancheDataLink.agentSummary"
msgid "Adds tools for Motion Design Data Link actors."
msgstr "Motion Design Data Link 액터용 도구를 추가합니다."

#. Key:	AvalancheDataLink.whenToEnable
msgctxt "NeoStack.IntegrationMetadata,AvalancheDataLink.whenToEnable"
