msgstr "에디터 패널 없이 Remote Control 출력 프로세서 매핑 구성"

#. Key:	AvalancheSceneState.agentSummary
msgctxt "NeoStack.IntegrationMetadata,AvalancheSceneState.agentSummary"
msgid "Adds tools for Motion Design Scene State actors."
msgstr "Motion Design Scene State 액터용 도구를 추가합니다."

#. Key:	AvalancheSceneState.whenToEnable
msgctxt "NeoStack.IntegrationMetadata,AvalancheSceneState.whenToEnable"
msgid "Your project uses UE's beta Motion Design Scene State Integration plugin."
msgstr "프로젝트에서 UE의 베타 Motion Design Scene State Integration 플러그인을 사용합니다."

#. Key:	AvalancheSceneState.enablesAgentTo.0
msgctxt "NeoStack.IntegrationMetadata,AvalancheSceneState.enablesAgentTo.0"
msgid "Create the embedded Motion Design Scene State blueprint"
msgstr "임베디드 Motion Design Scene State 블루프린트 생성"

#. Key:	AvalancheSceneState.enablesAgentTo.1
msgctxt "NeoStack.IntegrationMetadata,AvalancheSceneState.enablesAgentTo.1"
